+#### `forceUpload`
+
+*   Uploads the local collection to AnkiWeb, overwriting the remote side. Equivalent to choosing *Upload to AnkiWeb* in the desktop sync conflict dialog. Required when the local and remote collections have diverged enough that `sync` is refused (`FULL_SYNC` required, status `4` of `SyncCollectionResponse.ChangesRequired`). The collection is closed for the duration of the transfer and reopened on completion; this call blocks until the transfer finishes.
+
+    <details>
+    <summary><i>Sample request:</i></summary>
+
+    ```json
+    {
+        "action": "forceUpload",
+        "version": 6
+    }
+    ```
+    </details>
+
+    <details>
+    <summary><i>Sample result:</i></summary>
+
+    ```json
+    {
+        "result": null,
+        "error": null
+    }
+    ```
+    </details>
+
+#### `forceDownload`
+
+*   Downloads the AnkiWeb collection, overwriting the local side. Equivalent to choosing *Download from AnkiWeb* in the desktop sync conflict dialog. A backup of the local collection is taken before it is replaced, matching the desktop behavior. The collection is closed for the duration of the transfer and reopened on completion; this call blocks until the transfer finishes.
+
+    <details>
+    <summary><i>Sample request:</i></summary>
+
+    ```json
+    {
+        "action": "forceDownload",
+        "version": 6
+    }
+    ```
+    </details>
+
+    <details>
+    <summary><i>Sample result:</i></summary>
+
+    ```json
+    {
+        "result": null,
+        "error": null
+    }
+    ```
+    </details>
+
